<title>FRANCE: AGF Q1 sales up 1.4 percent.</title>
<headline>AGF Q1 sales up 1.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					18,319    vs   18,066</p>
<p>Breakdown by sector</p>
<p>    -- Life insurance in France		5,007    vs    5,395</p>
<p>    -- Non-life in France			5,446    vs    5,874</p>
<p>    -- Insurance outside France		5,716    vs    5,260</p>
<p>    -- Credit insurance			  2,143    vs	712</p>
<p>    -- Reinsurance				     7    vs	825</p>
<p>NOTE - AGF said in a statement that on a like-for-like basis sales would have been down by 2.4 percent. Reinsurance sales were down markedly due to the sale of SAFR.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
